{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_title", "source_sha256": "f08b87204eecd56591cf2345f007472275e691527a786e4aeec8da6a6be913db", "ja": "君だからできること", "zh": "只有你才办得到的事", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cd5062afc51c8b2db4b7fe2782f6fcfad18f40d151b100e0afef05a6a41906fc", "ja": "レッスンがうまくいかず落ち込むひなたの\n元に、亜美に盆栽を枯らされたと怒る真美が\nやってくる。田舎のじいちゃんの知恵で\n盆栽を蘇らせたひなたは自信を取り戻し、\nセンター公演をも成功に導くのだった。", "zh": "日向练习得不顺利而陷入低潮，这时候\n真美跑了过来，她正因盆栽被亚美弄枯\n而怒气冲冲。日向运用乡下爷爷的智慧\n救起盆栽后找回自信，也连带为\nCenter公演带来成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6158ee0f91251e4697ff27d33652f57abcda687415244018410f2052124440af", "ja": "（ひなたのセンター公演。ひなたは最初のうちこそ、\n少し自信がなさそうにしていたけど……）", "zh": "（今天是日向的Center公演。\n虽然她起初看起来有点没自信……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "32b3dfcfe33b7c96145da5f43b2c2553075934b2c4a1ce9ffa359be3b6d5ffd4", "ja": "みんな、あたしの歌、聴いてくれてありがとねぇ！\nみんなが応援してくれたおかげで、がんばれたよぉ！", "zh": "谢谢大家听我唱歌哪～！\n都是因为有大家的声援，我才能努力到现在喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "e9dcf3cd0d3f3a9da101608d822cb95e5d274fff5dc02df34e710950cdec453f", "ja": "あたし、これからもアイドル、がんばるから……\nしたっけ、またねぇ！", "zh": "我以后也会努力做好偶像的工作……\n那，下次再见哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1003_audience", "source_sha256": "aef9253428550be43f47420676289b7c402e8fe4b24675e710cee1ee876542a6", "ja": "ワアアァァーーーッ！！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1004_audience", "source_sha256": "90da573cbd97a9585ddc1a1d4c558caabacb59d8a4a2795aab04a91cae8b68c6", "ja": "ひなたちゃーん！\nアンコール、アンコール！", "zh": "日向～！\n安可、安可！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1b3e57f8c50d8d96bed2e0ab0d780ed2b5f847a96e04883c61576fd0d9332229", "ja": "ひなた、お疲れさま！", "zh": "日向，辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "a61cba336ae38b15bb885923ba9fa53d1540767ec304df9d813cc72ac21109f0", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。{$P$}……。\nあたし、ちゃんとできてたかい？", "zh": "呼、呼……{$P$}……\n我的表现好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1007_p", "source_sha256": "978bf37e7ab308ca05a9aa24615e662c9588515d867df28a9a293a0483d5939b", "ja": "うん、100点満点中の120満点だ！\n頑張ってくれてありがとう。", "zh": "嗯，以满分100分来说，你拿了120分！\n谢谢你的卖力演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "b44134bb5d0894d8fcb46c313c2408eb35a13412465bec60c0a4504130369356", "ja": "本当かい！？　う、うれしいよぉ……ぐすっ。", "zh": "真的吗！？我、我好开心哪……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "fe942e3fa64ffe1dc6537a6796a16913a2998dc9db16626410f03f369e204371", "ja": "あたし、ほんとにちゃんとできるか不安だったけど……\nみんなが一緒にいてくれたから、勇気が出たんだよぉ。", "zh": "我原本一直很担心，怕自己会表演得不好……\n但是多亏有大家在，让我充满了勇气哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a08b08ac87ffb4b4bd1b60ba9e038c648ed65722d4410278328fb7de16c4e2e5", "ja": "そうか……うん、泣いても大丈夫だよ。\n本当によくやった！", "zh": "这样啊……你哭出来也没关系喔。\n你真的表现得很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "6ecfde1db4f29126756b3a988fa3c805f07b08b6d6c03b14b064ac47400ab328", "ja": "えへへ……ありがとさんです。\nぐすっ。", "zh": "嘿嘿……谢谢你。\n呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "910def8753b82031100b167a453598d55838e7f2cb2bf8be611cde977d97c568", "ja": "ひなぴー！\nちょーちょースゴいステージだったよねっ！", "zh": "小日日！\n这场表演真的超超超～级精彩的耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "cb95d7b724fc4ba9c8116798387dde8d7adfac18748ad5e4e80509b425a5e3dd", "ja": "亜美もカンドーしたよっ！", "zh": "亚美也觉得很感动喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "5f7680e00193054af76e4671b1f1e3048a6e915e3cf83ba0e51a4b0d0db4370a", "ja": "真美センセー、亜美シショー……。\nふたりとも、ありがとうねぇ。", "zh": "真美老师、亚美师傅……\n谢谢你们哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "c6f51ebe4a3bb2571e8ca41f701565444a7479ce768966b7c783920560cda76a", "ja": "ひなたちゃん、これでわかりましたか？\nひなたちゃんには、すごい力があるんですよ～。", "zh": "小日，这下子你应该懂了吧？\n你身上拥有很强大的力量喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "dd78ad4fea7d225198fd8dbd80204522ead685aecfc16fe0124b75ead96b8f29", "ja": "そうなのです。ぼんさいのボンノスケだけでなく、\nファンのみんなを、元気にしちゃう力なのです！", "zh": "就是说呀，不只是盆栽盆之助，\n你也让粉丝们都充满活力了唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "5da528e529f1069573c6be5a8b70680afe942fd7f9f3fdedead7d1d4a1878c73", "ja": "そんな、えへへ……あたしのほうこそ、\nファンのみんなに元気にしてもらって……。", "zh": "没有啦，嘿嘿……\n应该说是粉丝们为我带来了活力才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "2500875c7795f29ada9f446e6928d2600149c11b36224054df1d9da2c6857c81", "ja": "それに、劇場のみんなにも……あたしの力なんて、\nちょっこしだけだよぉ。みんなのおかげだべさ！", "zh": "而且，还有剧场的大家……\n我的力量真的不大，都是托了大家的福哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3ff4fbcbab23ddcbe820d16f9275332854742cc2d78674d72c6de3e9b9d70264", "ja": "それでも、ひなたにしかできない、\nあったかいステージだったと思うよ。お疲れさま！", "zh": "尽管如此，我还是觉得这场温馨的表演，\n只有日向才能办得到喔，辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "2a3b37df49503d9fdf2bf9fc267db95598f685b0274f5fa121a39d3514966578", "ja": "そ、そうかい。そんなふうに言われると、\nあたし、がんばったかいがあったべさ。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？听到你这句话，\n就觉得我的努力有回报了哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1021_p", "source_sha256": "0e75024308c6b3924d04d4ebb63fa6ba44b64cc5f8ab6b62c3abedc77856a325", "ja": "（田舎から、アイドルになるために出てきた女の子。\nそのひなたが、あんなに立派にセンターを……）", "zh": "（为了当上偶像，从乡下来到大都市的女孩。\n这样的日向，成为了那么杰出的Center……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1022_p", "source_sha256": "c39263131b4d5af7a72dd38be2f40023b255d27fa204cd6b73c4d9d488822b25", "ja": "（う、だめだ！　涙腺が……）", "zh": "（唔，不行！泪腺快要……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "93fd12a150fd0c2c65dbc6ae657103e1690557f10ba839762af221a0cb9260a5", "ja": "……？　{$P$}、\nどうしたんだい？　大丈夫かい？", "zh": "……？{$P$}，\n你怎么了？不要紧吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1024_p", "source_sha256": "3da884ecab8e3f8f8d8f52a25b2fd6d0fc85969862ae8488ced1f6779a8d63a3", "ja": "あっ……ひなた、いたのか！\nみんなと控え室に戻ったのかと……。", "zh": "啊……日向，原来你在这啊！\n我以为你跟大家一起回准备室了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1025_035hin", "source_sha256": "e347145422aaa4d031bbda938dea3db2bbbde54c858e699211a07bd2951cf44c", "ja": "うん……あたしね、{$P$}に\n伝えたいことがあって、戻ってきたんだぁ。", "zh": "嗯……不过我呀，有事想跟{$P$}说，\n所以又回来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "09977b1157feaaa34fbd84a961f078c25c59e3d3f7a1c2382d322f9ec12bf90a", "ja": "あのね。あたしは田舎もんだし、ちっちゃいし、\nだから自信とかは、ぜんぜんなかったんだけども……。", "zh": "那个呀，因为我是乡下人，个子又小，\n所以一直很没有自信，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1027_035hin", "source_sha256": "bcb986e580e36cd9650ea3a02475f4780fb2710d054aaf6451e20abc1a565388", "ja": "{$P$}のおかげで、今日は\nアイドルに、ちょっこし近づけた気がするんだわ。", "zh": "托{$P$}的福，今天我觉得，\n自己稍微朝偶像靠近一步了哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1028_p", "source_sha256": "9396f8fffbbd220a8d9d04be01c4150e10d71332a45c6ab40b4dfd1bcac9ffb9", "ja": "ひなた……。", "zh": "日向……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1029_035hin", "source_sha256": "92bad961c937b15d1e687128aa677a507d65ae3bb9922375c9325bac1a270a13", "ja": "じいちゃんに電話かけるよう、言ってくれたでしょや？\nあのとき、家族みんなが応援してくれてねぇ。", "zh": "你之前不是建议我打电话给爷爷吗？\n那个时候，全家人都替我加油打气哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1030_035hin", "source_sha256": "6eafdd3a84c88f53b8aa9b9663b1e91f5899834f5601d6689e8691c92ae216a5", "ja": "たまに、田舎が恋しくなるけども。\n今のあたしの居場所は、劇場だって思ったんだよぉ。", "zh": "虽然我有时也会很怀念乡下，\n但我觉得，现在剧场就是我的归宿喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1031_p", "source_sha256": "7f5f8d0ddce2318624acced6c078b028f4ebedbaf621caecda9214b339e8b6ac", "ja": "……ああ、そうだな。\nアイドル木下ひなたの居場所は、劇場だ！", "zh": "……嗯，是啊。\n偶像木下日向的归宿，就是剧场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1032_035hin", "source_sha256": "467eab0c7f26e03b8bf44f7d953ae03f854645d28ff6bfe91f47210dfe32daed", "ja": "うん！　{$P$}。あたしを\nセンターに選んでくれて、本当にありがとうねぇ。", "zh": "嗯！{$P$}。\n真的很谢谢你选我当Center哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1033_035hin", "source_sha256": "cf3e543a80fe7b96d821905b1a80a72832856d6ddaad9d53f7b0ed807567c213", "ja": "こんなあたしだけど、\nこれからもどうぞ、よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "虽然我还不成熟，\n今后也要请你多多指教了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1034_p", "source_sha256": "a245c96a6f83c2a6784aaa7bc77ab9a5df7d4ccf3cc086cac7419d9f6447c779", "ja": "ああ。\nこちらこそ、これからもよろしくな！", "zh": "嗯。\n我也要请你多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_036_1035_p", "source_sha256": "b234f4224e1472c712785e1167cab5063ec31e413e83d84116038e779ad51ae6", "ja": "（ひなたの力は、このあったかさだ。きっといつか、\nもっと大勢の人を癒やすアイドルになるだろう！）", "zh": "（温暖就是日向的力量。\n总有一天，她会成为疗愈更多人的偶像！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
